IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-CONVERSION-STRATEGY.

DATA DIVISION.
01 D0-SUBSTRATE-TRUNK.
   05 D0-MOTZKIN-PRIME       PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
   05 D0-K-EXPONENT          PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
   05 D0-MAX-BOUND-BYTES     PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 D1-SOURCE-METRICS.
   05 D1-C-BEFORE-BYTES      PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.
   05 D1-C-AFTER-BYTES       PIC 9(9) USAGE R4.
   05 D1-ALGOL-COUNT         PIC 9(9) USAGE R5.
01 D2-GATING-DETENT.
   05 D2-G-SWIGLU-GATE       PIC 9(9) USAGE R6.
   05 D2-SHADOW-BYTES        PIC 9(9) USAGE R7.
   05 D2-COMMITTED-STATE     PIC 9(9) USAGE R8.
01 D3-LEAF-EVAL.
   05 D3-CONVERSION-RULING   PIC 9(9) USAGE R9.
   05 D3-DISP-WRAP-MOD       PIC 9(9) USAGE R10.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    MOVE 953467954 TO D0-MOTZKIN-PRIME.
    MOVE 3 TO D0-K-EXPONENT.
    MOVE 68000 TO D0-MAX-BOUND-BYTES.
    MOVE 67972 TO D1-C-BEFORE-BYTES.
    MOVE 18500 TO D1-C-AFTER-BYTES.
    MOVE 60 TO D1-ALGOL-COUNT.

    PERFORM STAGE-DECOUPLING-METRICS.
    PERFORM EVALUATE-DECOUPLED-COMMIT.
    PERFORM SYNC-DISPLACEMENT-MOD.

    IF D2-SHADOW-BYTES == D1-C-BEFORE-BYTES AND D1-C-AFTER-BYTES < 30000
        MOVE 0 TO D3-CONVERSION-RULING
        SET depth 4
    ELSE
        MOVE 3 TO D3-CONVERSION-RULING
        SET depth 1
    END-IF.

    EVAL.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

STAGE-DECOUPLING-METRICS.
    MOVE D1-C-BEFORE-BYTES TO D2-SHADOW-BYTES.
    COMPUTE D2-G-SWIGLU-GATE = 875 + ((125 * (D1-C-BEFORE-BYTES - D1-C-AFTER-BYTES)) / D1-C-BEFORE-BYTES).
    EXIT.

EVALUATE-DECOUPLED-COMMIT.
    COMPUTE D2-COMMITTED-STATE = (((D1-C-AFTER-BYTES * 1000) + (D1-ALGOL-COUNT * 100)) * D2-G-SWIGLU-GATE) / 1000.
    EXIT.

SYNC-DISPLACEMENT-MOD.
    COMPUTE D3-DISP-WRAP-MOD = D2-COMMITTED-STATE - ((D2-COMMITTED-STATE / 256) * 256).
    EXIT.

END-STRATEGY.
